              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">b8f5cb58-b02d-4086-91f4-0401a094cc74</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">REVIEW
Stage selects the visible result, not the calculation to run.
Case selects a saved response after completion.
Field 0: FEM stress or design density. Field 1: displacement.
Field 2: stress; during optimization this is RELAXED design stress.
Set the same positive legend maximum to compare a field across stages.
Deformation scale changes display only. Report contains all cases.</item>
                  </items>
